{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8811930a-9567-8f5e-b6da-1fe6405153af",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T12:41:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water and sewer billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. My name is Judith Chase. I am calling for my mother, her account. I need to change mailing address, and also I want to go paperless. This paper bill every month is a waste, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Do you have the bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it in my hand now. The date on top says December ninth. Is that the bill date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the bill date, yes. Is there an account number near it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Wait, it is small print. [pause] Okay, I read it to you. But first, what is the new mailing address? I must give it to you, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Go ahead with the new mailing address, and then the account number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The new one is a post office box, my mother wants it so. I will send the details by the form, you have a form? Because on the phone I do not want to make a mistake. I have already lost one hour with this today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do have a change-of-address form, and I can email the paperless sign-up link if you give me an address through the secure form on our website. Or I can note the account now and you can finish it online."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, online is fine. One more question. If I want to pay when the office is closed, evening, the weekend, is there a drop box for payments? I do not want to stand in line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a payment drop box at City Hall that's available after we close. Checks or money orders, with your account number on it. You can also pay online."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That I can do. Also, our block is planning a potluck this month, so I am busy with that, too. I want this finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note the account for the address change. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
